WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,430 --> 00:00:09,830
Younger brother Song Yuan

2
00:00:09,950 --> 00:00:11,110
How was your harvest today?

3
00:00:11,810 --> 00:00:13,970
Mom, my brother-in-law is so awesome

4
00:00:14,170 --> 00:00:15,890
We both got a lot of prawns

5
00:00:16,410 --> 00:00:22,350
good guy

6
00:00:22,710 --> 00:00:24,990
Jianguo is so lucky, right? There are so many prawns.

7
00:00:25,190 --> 00:00:26,310
It must be sold for a lot of money.

8
00:00:26,710 --> 00:00:27,630
What did I say?

9
00:00:27,830 --> 00:00:29,830
Zhang Jianguo and his family have some opinions on their boats.

10
00:00:31,690 --> 00:00:33,650
Jianguo, you got the prawns

11
00:00:34,390 --> 00:00:36,150
Yes, Tie Shu will marry his aunt.

12
00:00:36,710 --> 00:00:38,710
I just got the discouragement yarn from her yesterday

13
00:00:39,030 --> 00:00:40,630
Now I got so many prawns again

14
00:00:40,910 --> 00:00:47,260
Zhang Jianguo is really my God of Wealth. I have to hold on to five yuan, one pound, five yuan and two.

15
00:00:47,660 --> 00:00:48,700
If you are willing to pay this price

16
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:50,180
Take these prawns and iron mice with you

17
00:00:50,740 --> 00:00:51,740
Price of five dollars and two

18
00:00:51,740 --> 00:00:53,340
It’s two cents lower than what Wang Zhiqiang gave me.

19
00:00:53,660 --> 00:00:55,020
But that's all I can do for now

20
00:00:55,460 --> 00:00:56,380
Money is really important

21
00:00:56,700 --> 00:00:58,020
But saving life is the first priority

22
00:00:58,790 --> 00:01:01,070
If someone else wanted to sell the shrimp, it would be better to put down the price.

23
00:01:01,070 --> 00:01:02,670
But when I met Zhang Jianguo, I couldn’t help it.

24
00:01:02,950 --> 00:01:03,990
If it happens by chance

25
00:01:03,990 --> 00:01:04,910
This time in anger

26
00:01:04,910 --> 00:01:06,990
Then pull all these prawns back to make dried prawns

27
00:01:07,150 --> 00:01:08,070
That would be a big loss

28
00:01:08,550 --> 00:01:09,590
Five dollars and two is five dollars and two

29
00:01:10,740 --> 00:01:11,820
Anyway, I still make some money

30
00:01:12,340 --> 00:01:15,580
It’s just a matter of making more money and making less money.

31
00:01:16,140 --> 00:01:18,540
Three hundred and forty-five pounds of prawns, $5.2 per pound

32
00:01:18,820 --> 00:01:20,260
I got one thousand nine hundred and four in this wave.

33
00:01:20,540 --> 00:01:23,060
The total deposits reached 6,000 yuan Jianguo

34
00:01:23,380 --> 00:01:24,580
Come to my house for a drink in the evening

35
00:01:24,780 --> 00:01:27,770
Let's continue rescuing people. We're tired after a long night.

36
00:01:27,970 --> 00:01:28,890
I don’t want to move when I go back

37
00:01:29,170 --> 00:01:30,370
Another day Another day

38
00:01:30,370 --> 00:01:31,850
Want to buy me a drink and trick me into talking?

39
00:01:32,530 --> 00:01:34,810
We have to catch the last wave of prawns quickly in the next two days.

40
00:01:35,590 --> 00:01:36,950
And then there will be lingering spiritual disasters

41
00:01:37,310 --> 00:01:38,230
It doesn't matter

42
00:01:38,890 --> 00:01:40,010
Whoever wants to do it can do it
